{"nodes": [{"id": "maa_baglamkhi_resort_frontend_reports_hag_54_restaurant", "label": "HAG-54 Report: Restaurant / Banquet / POS Slice", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-frontend/reports/HAG-54-restaurant.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "0 of the 28 alerts in the 12 restaurant/banquet/POS files were dead stubs - each is a pre-flight validation guard or a post-call catch - so 0 frontend edits were made; all 23 endpoints the slice calls were verified live with a real session (reads 200 with payloads, empty-body writes 400 with handler-specific validation messages). The admin@resort.com credential was broken because the stored bcrypt hash did not match the seed-db.js seed value admin123, so a fresh account was registered to verify against, and an earlier '401 cannot prove a route is dead' claim was retracted as a shell quoting artifact, not backend behaviour. The App.jsx:278 role-gate defect (RestaurantDashboard mounted with only ['waiter'] instead of ROLES.RESTAURANT) was closed by another engineer; the open finding is that /kitchen-dashboard and /restaurant-dashboard are unreachable from any navigation, with getRoleHome() the only route in."}, {"id": "maa_baglamkhi_resort_frontend_reports_maa_frontend_kitchendashboard", "label": "/kitchen-dashboard route (KitchenDashboard page)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-frontend/reports/HAG-54-restaurant.md", "source_location": "App.jsx:274", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mounted at App.jsx:274 behind an inline ['kitchen'] gate and mapped for the kitchen role by getRoleHome(); before the HAG-59 sidebar change it had no nav link anywhere, so only a user who typed the path could open it. Its data comes from GET /kitchen/orders (one order row observed live: id 81, status Ready, kot_no KOT-1792309151141) plus GET /housekeeping; the page is read-only - it renders stat cards, insights and a 10-row status table with no write controls."}, {"id": "maa_baglamkhi_resort_frontend_reports_maa_frontend_restaurantdashboard", "label": "/restaurant-dashboard route (RestaurantDashboard page)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-frontend/reports/HAG-54-restaurant.md", "source_location": "App.jsx:277", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mounted at App.jsx:277 behind ROLES.RESTAURANT after the role-gate defect (originally ['waiter'] only, fixed to ROLES.RESTAURANT by another engineer). Its data comes from GET /restaurant/order plus GET /kitchen/orders, and its single button dismisses the socket-driven ready notification. Before the HAG-59 sidebar change it was unreachable from any navigation, with getRoleHome() the sole route in."}], "edges": [{"source": "maa_baglamkhi_resort_frontend_reports_hag_54_restaurant", "target": "maa_baglamkhi_resort_frontend_reports_maa_frontend_app", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-frontend/reports/HAG-54-restaurant.md", "source_location": "App.jsx:274,277", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "maa_baglamkhi_resort_frontend_reports_hag_54_restaurant", "target": "maa_baglamkhi_resort_frontend_reports_maa_frontend_rolehome", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-frontend/reports/HAG-54-restaurant.md", "source_location": "utils/roleHome.js:21,23", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "maa_baglamkhi_resort_frontend_reports_hag_54_restaurant", "target": "maa_baglamkhi_resort_frontend_reports_maa_frontend_kitchendashboard", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Maa-Baglamkhi-Resort-frontend/reports/HAG-54-restaurant.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "maa_baglamkhi_resort_frontend_reports_hag_54_restaura